            <title>[ZEPPELIN-389] Longer Paragraph Title will wrap to new line and interfere with code below</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-389</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If the paragraph title is longer than 1 line, the text wraps to next line and covers the code or anything below the title in the paragraph.&lt;/p&gt;

